  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dry-run support for Brazil&apos;s compliance with EU Deforestation Regulation (EUDR) in the soy sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this dry-run is to identify best practices, current gaps and learning points on a detailed technical level in relation to the new exportation requirements in the soy chain &#x2013; as much is still unclear on the implementation rules to the involved parties. As a result, traders, producers and government entities in Brazil and from the Netherlands Food and Consumer Product Safety Authority (NVWA) will have discovered what to work on before the European Union (EU) Deforestation Regulation (DR) becomes effective by the end of 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
